    "title": "SEEN: 35th Annual Van Rensselaer Awards Dinner - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Timesunion.com ,\n12 hours ago Were you Seen at the 35th Annual Van Rensselaer Awards Dinner on Sept. 18, 2025, at the Hilton Garden Inn in Troy?\nThe event was hosted by the Rensselaer County Regional Chamber of Commerce, led by President and CEO Norris Pearson. Award recipients included: DeCrescente Distributing Company, with the Corporate Award; Capital Region Workforce Development Board, with the Small Business Award; Unity House, with the Nonprofit Community Impact Award; and Carm Basile, former CEO of CDTA, with the Edward H. Pattison Citizenship Award.\nWere you Seen at 35th Annual Van Rensselaer Awards Dinner on Sept. 18, 2025, at the Hilton Garden Inn in Troy? (Ken Kozak/Agora Media) Sign up for Times Union newsletters here\nRead the original article on timesunion.com\n1",
